 "name_en": "Advanced Cash Operations (J78)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Advanced Cash Operations (J78)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loiof2134aac2a4c47c78c6b0f0d9eb386d1\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiof2134aac2a4c47c78c6b0f0d9eb386d1__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">With Advanced Cash Operations you can get a consistent view for the actual cash position as well as the short/mid-term cash forecast. Drill-down features are provided for the detailed transactions and rich dimensions are provided for the analysis. A comparison view between the actual and forecasted cash flow is also available.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">This scope item also allows you to make bank transfer and track its status, and to approve the bank payments and monitor the payment processing status.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiof2134aac2a4c47c78c6b0f0d9eb386d1__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Perform and track bank transfers</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Approve and monitor bank payments</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Monitor bank statement processing status</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Check cash reports (for example, Check Cash Position, Check Cash Flow Items, Cash Flow Analyzer, Cash Flow Comparison)</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiof2134aac2a4c47c78c6b0f0d9eb386d1__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Analyze cash position with finest granularity drill-down</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Forecast the liquidity trend and analyze the actual cash flows with rich dimensions (planning level, G/L account, planning group) in cash reports such as CCFI (Check Cash Flow Items) and CFA (Cash Flow Analyzer)</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Use advanced capabilities of Cash Flow Analyzer with bank account group view and liquidity item hierarchy view</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Compare the forecast snapshots made in the history with the actual cash flows</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Facilitate cash operations such as making bank transfers, tracking transfer statuses, approving payments (BCM integration), and monitoring payments</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Monitor the status of bank statement import processing easily</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>高级现金操作 (J78)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loiof2134aac2a4c47c78c6b0f0d9eb386d1\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiof2134aac2a4c47c78c6b0f0d9eb386d1__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">通过高级现金操作，您可以获得实际现金头寸以及短期/中期现金预测的一致视图。为详细交易提供了下钻功能，并为分析提供了丰富的维度。还可以使用实际和预测现金流之间的比较视图。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">此范围项目还允许您进行银行转账并跟踪其状态，以及审批银行付款和监控付款处理状态。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiof2134aac2a4c47c78c6b0f0d9eb386d1__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">执行和跟踪银行转账</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">审批和监控银行付款</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">监控银行对账单处理状态</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">检查现金报表（例如，检查现金头寸、检查现金流项目、现金流分析器、现金流比较）</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiof2134aac2a4c47c78c6b0f0d9eb386d1__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">使用最精细的下钻分析现金头寸</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">在现金报表（例如 CCFI（检查现金流项目）和 CFA（现金流分析器）中预测流动性趋势并分析具有丰富维度（计划级别、总账科目、计划组）的实际现金流</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">使用现金流分析器的高级功能，以及银行账户组视图和流动性项目层次结构视图</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">将历史记录中的预测快照与实际现金流进行比较。</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">促进现金操作，例如进行银行转账、跟踪转账状态、审批付款（BCM 集成）以及监控付款</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">轻松监控银行对账单导入处理的状态</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
